   {
    "heading": "Scenario 1: An interviewer says your portfolio looks visually impressive but does not demonstrate enough UX thinking. How would you respond?",
    "body": "తెలుగు: ఆ feedback‌ను స్వీకరిస్తాను. నా case studyలో user problem, research insights, user flows, design decisions మరియు validation process‌ను మరింత స్పష్టంగా వివరిస్తాను. Visual design మాత్రమే కాకుండా, ప్రతి design decision వెనుక ఉన్న reasoning‌ను కూడా చూపిస్తాను.",
    "scenario": true,
    "bodyEnglish": "I would acknowledge the feedback. I would make the user problem, research insights, user flows, design decisions, and validation process more visible in my case study. I would demonstrate not only the visual design but also the reasoning behind each major design decision."
   },
   {
    "heading": "Scenario 2: An interviewer asks you to show the actual business impact of your previous project, but you cannot share the metrics. What would you say?",
    "body": "తెలుగు: ఆ project‌కు సంబంధించిన confidential metrics‌ను నేను share చేయలేను. అయితే project objectives, నా individual contribution, design approach మరియు available qualitative learnings‌ను వివరించగలను. Confidentiality‌ను గౌరవిస్తూనే నా design capabilities‌ను స్పష్టంగా demonstrate చేస్తాను.",
    "scenario": true,
    "bodyEnglish": "I cannot share confidential metrics related to that project. However, I can explain the project objectives, my individual contribution, design approach, and available qualitative learnings. I can demonstrate my design capabilities while respecting confidentiality."
   }
